@startuml
title v3.1 Phase 115 — Persona impact lanes

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FAF7F2
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FAF7F2
  BorderColor #2C2826
  FontColor #2C2826
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor<<shipped>> #7CB479
  BackgroundColor<<inflight>> #C97B5B
  BackgroundColor<<risk>> #E6A23C
  BackgroundColor<<readonly>> #5C6776
  BorderColor #2C2826
  FontColor #2C2826
}

|Operator|
start
#5C6776:.planning/STATE.md\nchecks current milestone and phase;
-> "starts from canonical state";
|Codex executor|
#C97B5B:super-gsd/tools/chronicle/templates/puml/*.puml\ncreates diagram templates only;
-> "hands static templates to renderer";
|Claude orchestrator|
#7CB479:super-gsd/scripts/codex-exec.sh\ntracks Dispatch A execution receipt;
-> "records executor outcome";
|Reviewer|
#7CB479:super-gsd/tools/mesh-memory/review-finding-writer.cjs\ncaptures review findings as CMBs;
-> "links findings to evidence";
|Future maintainer|
#C97B5B:super-gsd/tools/chronicle/templates/sections/persona-impact.md\nreads persona impact slots;
-> "uses citations to trace change effect";
|Chronicle reader|
#C97B5B:super-gsd/tools/chronicle/templates/style.css\nscans rendered chronicle output;
stop

{{persona_lanes}}

@enduml
